{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/extras/5861ad760cb9ba44ecdd51ca6d77e071.poster.avif?t=1761786063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/extras/5861ad760cb9ba44ecdd51ca6d77e071.webm?t=1761786063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombie horde is here and no one was prepared. You are alone, but you can find other unassuming survivors to build your crew. Utilize whatever weapons, tools, and skills are at your crew's disposal to survive the horde and live through another night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/extras/1672469d97463dfaec156e3696492ae7.poster.avif?t=1761786063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/extras/1672469d97463dfaec156e3696492ae7.webm?t=1761786063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a lone survivor of the zombie apocalypse and gain stats as you defeat more zombies! <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/extras/eecaa3f9837c9a4857e86824c9d53882.poster.avif?t=1761786063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/extras/eecaa3f9837c9a4857e86824c9d53882.webm?t=1761786063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night progresses, other survivors will be available to be recruited to your crew. Level up each crew member's skills individually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/extras/ede2832907cbaa1c313f29aaa48a5a8f.poster.avif?t=1761786063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/extras/ede2832907cbaa1c313f29aaa48a5a8f.webm?t=1761786063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outlast the horde on throughout nights, unlocking new survivors, and gaining upgrades to strengthen your crew permanently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097880?t=1761786063","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097880?t=1761786063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/2320bcbcd9606ecc505eeb88dc8c50bb5cb005ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761786063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/2320bcbcd9606ecc505eeb88dc8c50bb5cb005ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761786063","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097880/extras/5861ad760cb9ba44ecdd51ca6d77e071.poster.avif?t=17617